The only other file matching `mysql\.` outside `store/db/mysql/` itself is `store/test/containers.go`, but its `mysql` identifier is the unrelated `github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-go/modules/mysql` test-container package (see import at `store/test/containers.go:20`), not this repo's driver package — it spins up a MySQL container for integration tests, it doesn't construct the `store/db/mysql` driver. So outside `store/db/db.go`'s factory, the MySQL driver package is never imported or constructed anywhere else in the codebase.
